{"_id":"6aa4ce473eaa602a1688745f","id":"openthomas/weather-forecasts","author":"openthomas","sha":"92cceb708020e61efebc9fcaef05152ca5116d00","lastModified":"2026-10-29T02:53:35.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["license:mit","region:us","weather","numerical-weather-prediction","prediction-markets","forecasting","graphcast","gencast","build-in-public"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOpenThomas weather forecasts\n\t\n\nEvery forecast the OpenThomas weather desk read or\nproduced, as-of. Pushed daily from the trading box, so each commit is a\ntimestamped record of what was known when — the leak-free substrate behind\nthe paper's replay experiments (docs/EXPERIMENTS.md in the\nharness repository).\n\n\t\n\t\t\nfile\nwhat\nlines / bytes\n\n\n\t\t\ndata/nwp-guidance-and-settlements.jsonl\nas-of daily extremes from seven public NWP models (Open-Meteo previous-runs API) at leads 0-5, plus… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/openthomas/weather-forecasts.","downloads":2088,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"mit","tags":["weather","numerical-weather-prediction","prediction-markets","forecasting","graphcast","gencast","build-in-public"],"pretty_name":"OpenThomas weather forecasts"},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"data/baseline-gfsmos.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"data/baseline-nbm.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"data/gencast-spread.json"},{"rfilename":"data/graphcast-tempseries.json"},{"rfilename":"data/nwp-guidance-and-settlements.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"data/own-models.jsonl"},{"rfilename":"replay/e3-high9.txt"},{"rfilename":"replay/e3-low1.txt"},{"rfilename":"replay/e3-low2.txt"},{"rfilename":"replay/e3e4.log"},{"rfilename":"replay/e3e4.sh"},{"rfilename":"replay/e4.log"},{"rfilename":"replay/e4.sh"},{"rfilename":"replay/e4.txt"},{"rfilename":"replay/lineage.json"},{"rfilename":"replay/results-2026-07-09-to-2026-09-11.json"},{"rfilename":"replay/results-2026-07-09-to-202